dsh-vcc NOTICE
==============

dsh-vcc is a port of pi-vcc to DeepSeek Harness. The compiler and recall core
under src/core/ and src/extract/ is pi-vcc source, vendored verbatim except
for the mechanical changes listed in PATCHES.md.

